# Firestaff — csb domain template.
# Canonical source-string template for Chaos Strikes Back.
#
# Domain: csb
# Covers: CSB-specific runtime flow, launcher/runtime text,
#         champion selection, utility, new-adventure, resume semantics,
#         Hint Oracle text, engine version display.
#
# Source-locked strings derived from CSB runtime, ReDMCSB
# DIALOG.C, CSBWin/Chaos.cpp, ReDMCSB ACTIDRAW.C, ReDMCSB
# ENTRANCE.C, CHANGE7_36 (CSB version 2.1), CHANGE8_13.
#
# CSB-specific keys (msgid "csb.*") cover:
#   - Engine version display: v2.0 (DM1) / v2.1 (CSB)
#   - Reincarnation / Resurrection panel labels
#   - Chaos magic and Cooldown hints
#   - Grey Lord encounter text
#   - Hint Oracle intro text
#   - Champion-pool labels (4 max in CSB vs 16 in DM1)
#   - Save import path labels (CSB savegame to DM1 conversion)
#   - Neophyte mode toggle
#
# These keys are NOT shared with dm1.* / dm2.* / nexus.* /
# theron.*; the firestaff i18n system loads the right domain
# per game entry on the startup menu.
#
